{%- comment -%}
  gs-exhibition-status: works out an exhibition's status from its dates so labels and lists
  never go stale (DESIGN.md §7, proposals/content-model.md).
  Draft reference: untested until the theme is pulled.

  Params
    start  date value (e.g. exhibition.start_date.value). Required.
    end    date value. Blank means open-ended.
  Output   on-now | upcoming | past

  Compares calendar days using Liquid's 'now'. Storefront pages can be cached for a short
  time, so a status may lag briefly around midnight on a changeover day. Confirm the
  timezone Liquid uses for 'now' in the review theme before relying on same-day accuracy.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign today = 'now' | date: '%Y%m%d' | plus: 0
  assign s = start | date: '%Y%m%d' | plus: 0
  if end != blank
    assign e = end | date: '%Y%m%d' | plus: 0
  else
    assign e = 99991231
  endif
  if today < s
    echo 'upcoming'
  elsif today > e
    echo 'past'
  else
    echo 'on-now'
  endif
-%}
